and distancing fully intact.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.710
He's riding his bike to meet his friends

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:02.070
and he and Locke hanging
out some and they're

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:05.970
hanging out outside and
doing some explorations

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:07.890
in the neighborhood and I'm like, yes.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:12.810
Finally they're doing some of
the stuff that we used to do

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:14.400
Might get you hurt a little bit.

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:17.650
A little bit of innocent trespassing.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.976
Well, let's not, yeah, maybe, maybe.

00:05:19.976 --> 00:05:20.809
We don't know what they're doing.

00:05:20.809 --> 00:05:21.820
There might be some fences

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:22.653
that lead to some--

00:05:22.653 --> 00:05:24.580
I don't, we don't know.

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:26.258
Yeah, I don't know where they're going.

00:05:26.258 --> 00:05:28.480
We're not going to talk about
it publicly, by any means.

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:32.260
But I was encouraged that
they're out on their bikes

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.840
meeting each other in like--

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.530
Right, just like Stand By Me.

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:38.050
They're gonna go find a dead body.

00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:39.680
Well, don't spoil it for 'em.

