00:11:20.057 --> 00:11:22.290
"It's almost like
concrete, there's no sand.

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:24.165
'Cause he was complaining
about the sandy parts

00:11:24.165 --> 00:11:27.410
and then I just, I was
like, I was thinking,

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.180
what is the fatherly thing to do here?

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:32.100
What is the thing that he will remember?

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:36.560
And so I thought about
what happened with you

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:38.773
when you got drunk in high school.

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:41.710
What's that got to do with this?

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:44.520
Well in how I dropped you off

