I came back to meet you.

00:11:46.940 --> 00:11:47.800
Okay.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:49.700
I didn't really formulate this plan.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:51.040
It kind of just came to me in the moment

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:52.090
and then I was like, okay,

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:54.740
I'm going to leave him
on this straightaway.

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:55.573
I'm just going to bike

00:11:55.573 --> 00:11:58.140
and I'm not going to look back
and I'm going to disappear.

00:11:58.140 --> 00:12:00.610
Eat my dust, kid.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:03.440
I'm going to disappear
and I'm going to see

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:05.530
if he's gonna react,
if he's gonna respond,

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:07.300
if he's gonna grab hold of this moment.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:08.307
Stand up and pedal.

00:12:08.307 --> 00:12:11.080
And bike on this path.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:13.330
So I go, it's a long way

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:14.880
I go a long way.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:17.560
Just so you do know what you seem like

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:19.250
