Livid.

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:15.070
But at this point, I
was like, I just can't,

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.920
I can't do anything

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:20.300
I can't break his spirit anymore.

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:21.590
You could go back to the car

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:23.310
