wrong with his bike.

00:14:13.309 --> 00:14:17.220
Oh, it is the tire isn't it?

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:18.210
Is it the tire?

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.710
And it's my fault.

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:21.290
You patched.

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:22.560
No, no, no.

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:24.780
When I patched the front tire.

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:25.613
You dis-patched.

00:14:25.613 --> 00:14:26.920
I put it on.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:27.963
I pumped it up.

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:31.330
And I, you spin the wheel

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:33.680
to make sure that the brake
is not catching, right?.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:36.480
But something happened between

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:40.580
