time, regardless of the slope,

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:54.230
because he had this
resistance in the front brake.

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:57.387
And I was like, "Shepherd,
you bike is messed up, man.

00:14:57.387 --> 00:14:58.917
"Your front brake is catching

00:14:58.917 --> 00:15:02.170
"That is why you've had
such a hard time today."

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:03.003
And I was like,

00:15:03.003 --> 00:15:06.467
"Man, I am so sorry for everything
