00:15:06.467 --> 00:15:07.577
"I thought that you"--

00:15:07.577 --> 00:15:09.260
But you should have found it.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.430
You should have noticed.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:13.860
I said, "I thought that you
had just completely given up."

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:16.540
And I was like, he's been
playing too many video games.

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:19.540
He's lost his ability to be
outside, I've created a monster.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:22.750
And then he's laughing, now
we're laughing at each other.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:25.477
And I'm like, "Shepherd,
this is just a sign

00:15:25.477 --> 00:15:28.217
"that we need to ride
bikes more because you

00:15:28.217 --> 00:15:31.693
