00:15:34.387 --> 00:15:35.510
"We gotta ride bikes more.

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:36.343
I said, "You know what,

00:15:36.343 --> 00:15:39.780
"when we get home, I'm gonna
pick you out a new bike."

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:40.990
So we went home--

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:42.020
But we're gonna break it

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:43.290
and you have to figure out what's broken.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:44.840
Oh, my story's not done.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:45.673
Oh, dang.

00:15:45.673 --> 00:15:49.960
I buy a new bike and--

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:52.350
Yeah, 'cause you offered the old bike.

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:54.390
Rhett text me

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:57.067
And he's like, "Hey, does
this Lando need a bike?

00:15:57.067 --> 00:15:58.687
"I'm getting Shepherd a bigger one

00:15:58.687 --> 00:16:01.260
"'cause he's too small for
this one, maybe Lando?"

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:02.127
And you sent me a picture of it.

00:16:02.127 --> 00:16:04.200
But you didn't tell me that it was bunk.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:06.280
It's not, no, no, that it's my fault.

