00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:17.020
So we get a new bike.

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:19.630
And you had bought your
bike at the local bike shop,

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:20.493
which is what I wanted to do.

00:16:20.493 --> 00:16:22.420
Support local business.

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:25.240
But I decided not to do that
because I didn't want to,

00:16:25.240 --> 00:16:26.990
I'm trying not to go in places.

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:28.410
I'm still not even going
into grocery stores

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:29.957
Call me crazy, but we're still--

00:16:29.957 --> 00:16:30.790
I wouldn't call you crazy.

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:33.020
I would just call you a
bad dad and a bad shopper.

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.000
Right.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.343
We're trying to maintain,

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:37.590
because we're coming into the office

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:39.690
and we're working with each other

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.240
and then working with a
very small group of people,

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.200
everyone who's doing that

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:44.550
we're just trying to maintain essentially

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:46.690
an isolation until we
come and work together.

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:48.980
So everybody knows, hey, we're safe.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:51.500
So I'm not really going into any place.

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:54.620
And well,

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:57.220
so I ordered the bike online,

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:59.620
and I don't know, I've
never bought a bike online.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:00.827
I thought this means--

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.290
Some dudes gonna ride up on your body

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:04.890
Yeah, I thought UPS man just rode up,

