has been put together but
some very key elements

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:23.750
like the front fork is
not attached to the frame.

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:26.070
This is a, and that's kind of a key part

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:28.230
of the whole process, right?
Oh man.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:29.630
And I called the local bike shop

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:33.180
and I was like, "I just
got this bike in a box."

