00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:16.870
Knowing how easily this could go wrong?

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:18.500
It was gonna be ugly.

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:20.253
Seven minutes in I break it.

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:24.310
I'm trying to attach
the thing to the thing.

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:27.980
And I'm tightening it down

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:29.200
