00:19:13.957 --> 00:19:16.237
"You shouldn't have done this
box built in the first place.

00:19:16.237 --> 00:19:17.580
"And now you've screwed it up."

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:20.370
I hate that feeling, it's
worse when it's a car,

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:22.820
which I know we've both also done

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:25.600
in our early days of marriage.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:28.020
We thought we would impress our wives

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:29.310
by fixing our own cars.

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.660
Yeah, I totaled a car one time.

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:33.530
Engineering degrees do not help

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:35.440
