00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.273
And let me tell you,

00:19:36.273 --> 00:19:38.160
the YouTube videos were
not helpful at all.

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:39.800
At least the ones that I watched.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:43.680
So newsflash, I had to take
the bike to the bike shop.

