[Rhett} And then we develop this--

00:24:46.443 --> 00:24:47.490
It's the Randler.

00:24:47.490 --> 00:24:48.830
Version of the Randler.

00:24:48.830 --> 00:24:50.630
With he mythical logo.

00:24:50.630 --> 00:24:53.480
And now we know that the tie dye thing is,

